    scene c019_s001_026 with Dissolve(0.5)
    e "搞什么——"
    k "他已经在外面了。"
    scene c019_s001_027 with Dissolve(0.5)
    e "该死。帮我把这堆东西挪开。你们两个退后。"
    l "[player_name]？[player_name]！"
    scene c019_s001_028 with Dissolve(0.25)
